    "Newer persisted content remains eligible under the existing version rule; actual authorized source revalidation/time authority remains B137 held.",
    "CAS/local namespace evidence is bounded; no universal downstream authority, production evaluator truth or distributed atomicity is inferred.",
    "This independent reviewer read code, tests, release fragment and complete hashed deciding outputs and verified all 389 executed source origins per run. No new test/backend process was launched.",
